  "decision_rule": "V0.3 repairs only the public Binance provenance transport after HTTP 451 by using Binance's public checksum-verifiable historical archive. It must not consult or summarize economic values, must not select periods by outcomes, must preserve the frozen V0.1 timestamp-only coverage gate, and must write a diagnostic receipt even when that gate remains closed.",
